#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/bad_messages_populator.vala:168
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s has been using an untrusted device. You won't see messages from devices "
"that you do not trust."
msgstr ""
"%s a utilisé un appareil inconnu. Vous ne verrez pas les messages provenant "
"d'appareils en lesquels vous n’avez pas confiance."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/bad_messages_populator.vala:169
msgid "Manage devices"
msgstr "Gérer les appareils"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/bad_messages_populator.vala:171
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s does not trust this device. That means, you might be missing messages."
msgstr ""
"%s n’accorde pas sa confiance à cet appareil. Cela signifie que vous manquez "
"peut-être des messages."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:34
msgid "Manage Key"
msgstr "Gérer la clé"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:35
msgid ""
"Compare the fingerprint, character by character, with the one shown on your "
"contact's device."
msgstr ""
"Comparez l’empreinte, lettre par lettre, avec celle affichée sur l'appareil "
"de votre contact."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:36
msgid "Fingerprints differ"
msgstr "L’empreinte ne correspond pas"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:37
msgid "Fingerprints match"
msgstr "L’empreinte correspond"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:39
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Confirmer"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:59
msgid "Verify key"
msgstr "Vérifier la clé"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:60
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Future messages sent by %s from the device that uses this key will be "
"highlighted accordingly in the chat window."
msgstr ""
"Les prochains messages envoyés par %s depuis l'appareil utilisant cette clé "
"seront mis en valeur dans la fenêtre de discussion."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:70
msgid "Fingerprints do not match"
msgstr "Les empreintes ne correspondent pas"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:71
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Please verify that you are comparing the correct fingerprint. If "
"fingerprints do not match, %s's account may be compromised and you should "
"consider rejecting this key."
msgstr ""
"Veuillez vérifier que vous comparez la bonne empreinte. Si les empreintes ne "
"correspondent pas, le compte de %s pourrait être compromis et vous devriez "
"envisager de rejeter cette clé."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:123
msgid "Verify key fingerprint"
msgstr "Vérifier l’empreinte de cette clé"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:123
msgid ""
"Compare this key's fingerprint with the fingerprint displayed on the "
"contact's device."
msgstr ""
"Comparez cette empreinte avec celle affichée sur l'appareil du contact."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:125
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:151
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/encryption_preferences_entry.vala:288
msgid "Reject key"
msgstr "Rejeter cette clé"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:125
msgid ""
"Block encrypted communication with the contact's device that uses this key."
msgstr ""
"Bloquer les communications chiffrées avec l'appareil du contact qui utilise "
"cette clé."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:127
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:159
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/encryption_preferences_entry.vala:283
msgid "Accept key"
msgstr "Accepter la clé"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:127
msgid ""
"Allow encrypted communication with the contact's device that uses this key."
msgstr ""
"Autoriser les communications chiffrées avec l'appareil du contact qui "
"utilise cette clé."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:131
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:136
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:140
#, c-format
msgid "This key is currently %s."
msgstr "Cette clé est actuellement %s."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:131
msgid "accepted"
msgstr "acceptée"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:131
#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:136
#, c-format
msgid "This means it can be used by %s to receive and send encrypted messages."
msgstr ""
"Cela signifie qu’elle peut être utilisée par %s pour recevoir et envoyer des "
"messages."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:136
msgid "verified"
msgstr "vérifiée"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:136
msgid ""
"Additionally it has been verified to match the key on the contact's device."
msgstr ""
"De plus, vous avez précédemment vérifié que cette clé coïncide avec celle de "
"l'appareil de ce contact."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:140
msgid "rejected"
msgstr "rejetée"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:140
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This means it cannot be used by %s to decipher your messages, and you won't "
"see messages encrypted with it."
msgstr ""
"Cela signifie qu’elle ne peut pas être utilisée par %s pour déchiffrer vos "
"messages, et que vous ne verrez pas les messages chiffrés avec."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:152
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You won't see encrypted messages from the device of %s that uses this key. "
"Conversely, that device won't be able to decipher your messages anymore."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne verrez pas les messages de %s provenant de l'appareil qui utilise "
"cette clé. En retour, ce client ne pourra plus déchiffrer vos messages."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/manage_key_dialog.vala:160
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You will be able to exchange encrypted messages with the device of %s that "
"uses this key."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourrez échanger des messages chiffrés avec l'appareil de %s qui "
"utilise cette clé."

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/device_notification_populator.vala:73
msgid "Manage"
msgstr "Gérer"

#: main/src/plugins/omemo/ui/device_notification_populator.vala:80
